{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>Behold, the Name.</b> The sense of \"the Name\": that the deed of HaShem against the camp of Assyria will be heard." "And the sense of <b>from afar, from the heavens,</b> is because of the descent of the angel." "<b>And heavy is its burden.</b> Like \"and the portion of the loaf\" (Judges 20:40), for [these] are numerous names for smoke."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {2 "The bracketed word [רבות] appears to be supplied by the editor; translated as though part of the sentence."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:07.001328131Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}